                                    <h2>Categories That Compound in NYC</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Fashion + streetwear:</strong> NYC fashion week ecosystem + luxury casual.<br><strong>Beauty + skincare:</strong> Glossier + Fenty + clean beauty ecosystem.<br><strong>Home + furniture:</strong> Casper + Away + design-forward.<br><strong>F&amp;B + subscription:</strong> Blue Apron + specialty meal + coffee subscription.<br><strong>Wellness + supplements:</strong> Athletic Greens + Ritual + Care/of pattern.<br><strong>Fintech D2C:</strong> Chime + Robinhood-adjacent + specialty finance.</p>
                                    <h2>Realistic Budgets in NYC</h2>
